rea selected and the subnavigation open....instead of collapsed (which was shown above).\r\n\r\n![nav-home-masthead-docs-selected](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/31675481/41115799-cfd4d9c4-6a45-11e8-8bf7-27748b65427b.png)\r\n\r\nThe menu and TOC on the left are specific to the Docs area. When you go to the top of the site or another subarea (such as Features), they disappear because they aren't needed. There isn't enough content in those subareas to require the left TOC. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/395501832/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jenniferfell","id":31675481,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNjc1NDgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31675481?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell","html_url":"https://github.com/jenniferfell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":1669152867,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDE2NjkxNTI4Njc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/events/1669152867","actor":{"login":"jenniferfell","id":31675481,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNjc1NDgx","a